On Jan 29, 2008 3:46 PM, Isen hand <isenhand@yahoo.co.uk> wrote:

> X3 of moi is a rule. How do you make a rule? If I want to
> say something like this is the 2nd largest hat that I have how would
> I express the rule "larger than" if I used moi?


I believe [ka] works here: *remoi fi le ka [ce'u] barda* (second in
bigness/second biggest)


> Also, as x2 is a set am I correct in assuming that I can
> make all the hats I own a set by referring to them as le'i?


I believe so: *ti remoi le'i sedyta'u po mi le ka [ce'u] barda *(This is
second of the hats I own in bigness/This is my second biggest hat).

